# Turbo Road — environment configuration
#
# All values here are safe to commit. NEVER put API keys, keystore passwords,
# or receipts in this file or in any committed source.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Monetization mode (controls billing + ad providers at build time)
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# - `sandbox`  → Web simulator checkout & simulated rewarded/interstitial
#                (clearly labelled "Sandbox" in the UI). For local dev/tests.
# - `production` → Real store/ad providers. Without a native provider present,
#                purchases and ads are UNAVAILABLE and nothing is granted.
# - unset → Dev build: sandbox. Production (release) build: production.
#
# Do NOT set this to `sandbox` in a release APK.
#VITE_MONETIZATION_MODE="sandbox"
